      "sha": "136f777ae1dbdfee2664503468a9a3231d50925a",
      "message": "Report dropck normalization errors in borrowck\n\nHIR type checking no longer runs dropck, so we may get new errors when\nwe run it in borrowck. If this happens then rerun the query in a local\ninfcx and report errors for it.",
      "files": [
        "compiler/rustc_borrowck/src/type_check/liveness/trace.rs",
        "compiler/rustc_trait_selection/src/traits/query/dropck_outlives.rs"
      ]
